eader, 47 existing research cases and six tool schemas/result functions are preserved. Each fixture contains at most 12 MiB of synthetic payload. The limit covers retained text per session; it does not establish total process memory or hosted latency.\n\nValidation: signed clean source b7f7f1a9, allowed-path/preservation manifest and git diff --check. Existing remote CI and independent source/current-CI review are pending. Unreleased; no version, registry or site publication.\n","created_at":"2026-10-02T15:31:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T15:31:07Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"29ecad283734b1c11758f129a58d9ccd123d4885","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/366/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/366/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/366/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/statuses/b7f7f1a9e6a47e742d5bff69b4a68ac86bdcabe2","head":{"label":"arhancanli:assist/research-cache-bounds-20261002","ref":"assist/research-cache-bounds-20261002","sha":"b7f7f1a9e6a47e742d5bff69b4a68ac86bdcabe2","user":{"login":"arhancanli","id":315329124,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsuKZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315329124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us